// Sum of the labeled margins strictly above the smallest kept margin.
// One margin returns nothing. A greater margin is added again when repeated.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE masum ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG masum rank

IMPULSE masum 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "masum" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
